  "summary": "AI data center campus under construction by Hut 8 in West Feliciana Parish, Louisiana. Phase I is leased to Fluidstack for 245 MW of critical IT load under a 15-year lease valued at $7.0 billion, with Google backstopping the lease obligations; Hut 8 announced a partnership with Anthropic and Fluidstack the same day, and news reports say the capacity is for Anthropic. Entergy Louisiana is to supply an initial 330 MW, with potential to scale to 1,000 MW. Phase I investment is up to $10 billion. Local reporting in October 2026 counted about 1,200 construction workers on site and said the facility will serve Anthropic's Claude.",
